    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Medium Armor Training)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Strength or Dexterity score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Dexterous Wearer.</strong> While you're wearing Medium armor, you can add 3, rather than 2, to your AC if your Dexterity score is 16 or higher.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-KP1K13jmwx8h4qS8\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Not automated: add the +1 to your AC while you wear Medium armor with a Dexterity of 16 or more (an AC bonus on your sheet, for example).</p></section>",
